# PhotoPipe - Event-Driven Image Processing Pipeline

**CST8917 - Serverless Applications | Lab 4**

This is a small serverless app that processes images automatically when they are uploaded.
When I upload a picture to Azure Blob Storage, Azure Event Grid notices the new file and
sends an event to two Azure Functions. One function reads the image details, and the other
one keeps an audit log of every file that gets uploaded.

